	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>This app requires access to your photo library.</string>
	<!-- Location sharing. WHEN IN USE only, deliberately: there is no
	     NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription here and no "location"
	     entry in UIBackgroundModes below, so a live share updates while the app
	     is on screen and stops when it is not. The share still ENDS on time
	     regardless, because its deadline is enforced by the server — see
	     live_location_publisher.dart for that decision and what reversing it
	     would cost at App Review. -->
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>MonkeyHub uses your location only when you choose to share it in a chat. Live shares stop by themselves at the time you pick.</string>
